  robotName: Conductor
  robotDescription: 'The Mother''s beloved creation and the only one capable of taking
    her place. To prove her worth, she must save her swarm. The spider was given
    a vessel that allows her to command the insects under her command. '
  robotSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 232d47dffd669a74391071ffa43782d0, type: 3}
  abilityDescription: "Hollow Conductor: \n(active) [E]\n \nThe Spider jumps off
    the puppets head, focusing the control on the orginal body losing control over
    the swam, but allowing it to mine and attack.\n\nBy re-using this ability the
    Spider jumps onto the puppets head, regaining control over him and the entire
    swarm."
